{"type":"message","id":"76ce4948","parentId":"90ca038a","timestamp":"2026-05-25T00:03:08.304Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Key findings from the morning scan:\n\n1. **US Markets CLOSED today** - Memorial Day (May 25, 2026). NYSE and Nasdaq shut. CME futures early close.\n2. **Hong Kong markets also closed** - Memorial Day observance\n3. **Crypto Fear & Greed Index: 42** - Fear territory, down from 49 yesterday\n4. **A50 position**: Still holding at +5.46% profit, entry 100, current 105.46\n5. **No new signals to process** - holiday mode\n\nSince it's a holiday, there's nothing urgent. I should note the holiday status and the A50 position status. \n\nThe A50 index is tied to Chinese A-shares, so it operates on China's trading calendar rather than US holidays—meaning it could still be active today despite the American market closures.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"08:00 早盘扫描完成。关键发现：\n\n**📅 今日市场状态**\n- 🇺🇸 **美股休市** — Memorial Day，NYSE/Nasdaq 全天关闭\n- 🇭🇰 **港股休市** — 美国假期同步\n- CME 期货提前收市\n- A股正常开市（周一）\n\n**📊 持仓状态**\n- A50 多头：入场100 → 现价105.46 | 盈利 +5.46%\n- 止损95，止盈110，距止盈还有4.54%\n\n**😨 恐惧贪婪指数**\n- 加密市场：42（恐惧），较昨日49下降\n- 市场情绪偏弱\n\n**📌 今日关注**\n- 美股/港股休市，流动性低，A50波动可能放大\n- A50接近止盈区间，关注是否触及108-110区域\n- 加密情绪转恐惧，BTC观察是否有回调买点\n\n无紧急操作信号。继续持有A50，盯盘小级别背驰。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":322,"output":649,"cacheRead":44224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45195,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779667378197}}
