{"type":"message","id":"bf750364","parentId":"7f6b86e7","timestamp":"2026-05-25T12:03:03.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, got market data. Let me compile the evening scan report.\n\nKey findings:\n- A-shares: Shanghai +0.96% (4152.57), Shenzhen +1.66%, ChiNext +2.10%, STAR50 +5.88%\n- Strong day - tech/semiconductor driven\n- Gold: ~997 CNY/g (domestic), ~$4,563 (international)\n- A50 position should have moved up given the strong A-share day\n\nLet me calculate the A50 position update.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bec32a8bd6ea4ea49b1464c2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && python3 -c \"\n# A50 estimate: Shanghai index went from ~4113 (last known) to 4152.57 (+0.96%)\n# A50 entry at 100, previous price 105.46\n# A50 roughly tracks, let's estimate new price\nprev_price = 105.46\na_shares_change = 0.0096  # +0.96%\nest_new_price = prev_price * (1 + a_shares_change)\npnl_pct = (est_new_price - 100) / 100 * 100\nprint(f'A50 estimated price: {est_new_price:.2f}')\nprint(f'A50 estimated P&L: +{pnl_pct:.2f}%')\nprint(f'Take profit target: 110 (+10%)')\nprint(f'Distance to TP: {(110 - est_new_price)/est_new_price*100:.2f}%')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1936,"output":499,"cacheRead":46336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48771,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779710570888}}
