{"type":"message","id":"f24f0b25","parentId":"5d993c97","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:33:40.122Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive view. Let me analyze both repos:\n\n**hermes-sync (公开仓库)** - VAN wants to secure this\n- Public repo on GitHub\n- Contains: config files, memory, sessions, sync logic, workers, Cloudflare deployment\n- Has sensitive data exposed: AGENTS.md, MEMORY.md, USER.md, IDENTITY.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md\n- These contain personal preferences, user info, agent config - all in plaintext!\n\n**hermes-skills (当前工作仓库)**\n- The actual workspace\n- Has uncommitted changes\n- Contains all the trading systems, skills, etc.\n\nThe security issue is clear: hermes-sync has sensitive files in plaintext and it's public. \n\nNow I need to put together a full report on what's exposed and what needs to be secured.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"仓库全面检查完成。以下是完整报告：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 仓库全面检查报告\n\n### 1️⃣ hermes-sync（公开仓库 ⚠️）\n\n**地址：** `https://github.com/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync`\n**状态：** 🟢 Public | 分支：main | 最后更新：2026-05-24\n\n**文件统计：** 52个文件，18个目录\n\n**⚠️ 安全问题 — 敏感文件全部明文公开：**\n\n| 文件 | 内容 | 风险 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `AGENTS.md` | Agent行为规则、技能配置 | 🔴 中 |\n| `MEMORY.md` | 个人偏好、历史决策 | 🔴 高 |\n| `USER.md` | 用户名、飞书ID、角色定位 | 🔴 高 |\n| `IDENTITY.md` | Agent身份配置 | 🟡 中 |\n| `SOUL.md` | 安全规则、行为准则 | 🟡 中 |\n| `TOOLS.md` | API Key说明、数据源配置 | 🔴 高 |\n| `core/MEMORY.md` | 核心记忆文件 | 🔴 高 |\n| `core/USER.md` | 用户详细信息 | 🔴 高 |\n| `hermes-state.json` | 系统状态 | 🟡 中 |\n| `memory/sync.json` | 同步配置 | 🟡 中 |\n\n**目录结构概览：**\n```\nhermes-sync/\n├── .github/workflows/auto-sync.yml   ← CI自动同步\n├── .openclaw/workspace-state.json\n├── AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md   ← ⚠️ 明文敏感\n├── USER.md, TOOLS.md                  ← ⚠️ 明文敏感\n├── core/                              ← 核心配置（明文）\n│   ├── IDENTITY.md, MEMORY.md\n│   ├── SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, USER.md\n├── memory/                            ← 记忆数据（明文）\n│   ├── MEMORY.md, sync.json\n├── sessions/                          ← 会话管理\n├── skills/mimo-identity-restore/      ← 身份恢复技能\n├── workers/                           ← Cloudflare Workers\n│   ├── session_manager.ts\n│   └── src/index.ts\n├── hermes_sync.py, sync_client*.py    ← 同步脚本\n└── deploy.sh, start_sync.py           ← 部署脚本\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2️⃣ hermes-skills（当前工作仓库）\n\n**地址：** `origin → xianfanhuang/hermes-skills`\n**状态：** 有未提交变更\n\n**未提交的修改（8个文件）：**\n```\nM  cron/jobs.json              ← 定时任务配置\nM  cron/jobs.json.bak\nM  cron/runs/*.jsonl           ← 运行记录\nM  feishu/dedup/default.json   ← 飞书去重\nM  plugins/kimi-claw/locks/*   ← Kimi锁文件\nM  workspace/AGENTS.md         ← ⚠️ 有新增内容\nM  workspace/MEMORY.md         ← ⚠️ 有新增内容\nM  chanlun-agent/.../xiaomi_trader.log\n```\n\n**新增未跟踪文件：**\n```\n?? workspace/reports/daily/2026-05-23.md\n?? workspace/reports/daily/2026-05-24.md\n?? workspace/reports/daily/2026-05-25.md\n?? workspace/skills/hermes-skills/  ← 新技能模块\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3️⃣ 关键问题汇总\n\n| # | 问题 | 严重性 | 说明 |\n|---|------|--------|------|\n| 1 | hermes-sync 公开仓库含明文敏感数据 | 🔴 高 | 个人偏好、用户ID、API配置全部暴露 |\n| 2 | hermes-skills 有未提交变更 | 🟡 中 | 8个修改文件+3个日报未提交 |\n| 3 | 两仓库内容可能不同步 | 🟡 中 | hermes-sync 和 hermes-skills 内容不一致 |\n| 4 | 无加密保护 | 🔴 高 | 任何克隆者可获取全部敏感信息 |\n\n---\n\n### 4️⃣ 建议操作\n\n**紧急（今天）：**\n1. 用 git-crypt 加密 hermes-sync 的敏感文件\n2. 提交 hermes-skills 的未跟踪变更\n\n**短期（本周）：**\n3. 统一两仓库的同步机制\n4. 设置 vault/public 分区结构\n\n要我先处理哪个？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1810,"output":1408,"cacheRead":51904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55122,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779715997334}}
