{"type":"message","id":"3094ef3b","parentId":"642f273b","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:49:00.452Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking \"什么意思\" (what do you mean) - likely referring to my previous message about the push failure and GitHub token issue. Let me explain more simply.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"简单说：\n\n**文件全部准备好了，但推不上去。**\n\n原因：hermes-skills 仓库的 GitHub 地址里嵌入了你的访问令牌（密码），所以能正常推送。但 hermes-sync 仓库的地址里没有这个令牌，GitHub 拒绝了推送。\n\n就像：你有 hermes-skills 的钥匙，能开门；但 hermes-sync 的钥匙没给我。\n\n**解决办法（选一个）：**\n\n1. **你给我令牌** — 去 GitHub 生成一个 token，发给我，我配上就能推\n2. **你手动推** — 我把文件放在 `/tmp/hermes-sync/`，你本地执行一条命令：\n   ```\n   cd /tmp/hermes-sync && git push origin main\n   ```\n3. **把 hermes-sync 的令牌也配到 URL 里** — 跟 hermes-skills 一样的方式\n\n哪个方式方便？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":970,"output":270,"cacheRead":76992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78232,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779716931250}}
