{"type":"message","id":"85265530","parentId":"e564ad3e","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:52:09.175Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So hermes-skills also can't push! Both repos have the same issue - no valid GitHub token. The hermes-skills repo must have been set up previously with a token that's no longer valid, or it was set up in a different environment.\n\nSo VAN's question \"how do you normally access hermes-sync to modify files\" - the answer is, I actually can't push to either repo from this sandbox environment. Both require GitHub authentication that isn't available here.\n\nLet me be honest with VAN about this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了 — **其实 hermes-skills 也推不上去**。\n\n两个仓库的情况完全一样：URL 里的令牌字段是空的（`xianfanhuang:@github.com`），GitHub 拒绝认证。\n\n```\nhermes-skills → push ❌ 同样失败\nhermes-sync   → push ❌ 失败\n```\n\n**说明：** 这个沙箱环境里没有存储任何 GitHub 令牌。之前的所有提交（我看到的 git log）应该是在其他环境（比如你本地机器或 Coze 服务器）完成的。\n\n---\n\n## 现状\n\n- 文件全部准备好了，在 `/tmp/hermes-sync/`，commit 已完成\n- 推送到 GitHub 需要你的 Personal Access Token\n\n## 最快解决方案\n\n你在飞书发我一个 GitHub token（Fine-grained token，给 hermes-sync 仓库 Contents: Write 权限），我配上立刻推。\n\n或者你本地拉取：\n```bash\n# 本地执行\ngit clone https://github.com/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync.git\n# 然后把 /tmp/hermes-sync/ 的文件覆盖进去，push\n```\n\n怎么方便怎么来。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":350,"output":475,"cacheRead":79808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80633,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779717112884}}
{"type":"message","id":"88522083","parentId":"85265530","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:57:06.696Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-25 21:51:35 GMT+8] Exec completed (cool-cla, code 0) :: api.coze.cn/.well-known/token --- /usr/share/doc/git/contrib/credential/osxkeychain/git-credential-osxkeychain.c /usr/share/doc/git/contrib/credential/wincred/git-credential-wincr…\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e711dd0d0acc27a6ab0d32a5d2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 21:57 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e711dd0d0acc27a6ab0d32a5d2]\nVAN: 那你之前为什么能仓库拉取推送的？"}],"timestamp":1779717426694}}
{"type":"message","id":"688583a2","parentId":"88522083","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:57:31.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking how I was able to pull/push to the repos before. Let me think about this...\n\nLooking at the git log in hermes-skills, there are commits from the agent. And the clone of hermes-sync worked. So pulling works (public repos or repos with read access). But pushing requires authentication.\n\nThe question is - how were previous pushes done? Let me check if there's something I'm missing. Maybe the hermes-skills repo was set up differently, or maybe pushes were done through a different mechanism.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-examine. The hermes-skills clone exists at `/workspace/projects/` and has commits. But I tested `git push --dry-run` and it failed. So either:\n\n\n1. Previous pushes were done in a different environment (not this sandbox)\n2. There was a token that expired\n3. The pushes were done through some other mechanism\n\nThe commits show author \"agent\" with email `2553529733753963-agent@noreply.coze.cn`, which suggests they were done through the Coze platform. So pushes must have been happening from a different environment with proper authentication, not from this sandbox. I should be honest with VAN that I don't actually have write access here.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。让我查清楚。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5dd2298b56ee448cbc61d612","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects && git log --oneline --format=\"%h %an <%ae> %s\" -15"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_abf426d2a6ad4cec9241396c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check when the last successful push was and what changed\ncd /workspace/projects && git log --oneline --format=\"%h %ai %s\" -15"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":758,"output":644,"cacheRead":80128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81530,"c