{"type":"message","id":"64366913","parentId":"50300159","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:57:50.548Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see - all commits are from the Coze agent (email: `2553529733753963-agent@noreply.coze.cn`). These commits were made from the Coze platform environment, which likely had GitHub credentials configured differently. The current sandbox environment doesn't have those credentials.\n\nThe hermes-skills repo was likely cloned and set up in a Coze environment that had authentication configured. The current OpenClaw sandbox environment doesn't have the same credentials.\n\nLet me be honest with VAN about this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"查清楚了。**之前的推送不是从当前这个环境做的。**\n\n所有历史提交的作者都是：\n```\nagent <2553529733753963-agent@noreply.coze.cn>\n```\n\n这说明之前的 git push 是在 **Coze 平台的运行环境** 里完成的，那个环境配置了 GitHub 认证。\n\n当前这个 OpenClaw 沙箱环境：\n- ✅ 能读（clone/pull）— 公开仓库或有读权限\n- ❌ 能写（push）— 没有 GitHub 令牌\n\n---\n\n## 解决方案\n\n**方案1：你给我 token（最快）**\n在 GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → Fine-grained tokens → 生成一个 → 发给我\n\n**方案2：我生成文件，你手动推**\n文件已经在 `/tmp/hermes-sync/`，commit 已就绪，你本地：\n```bash\ncd /tmp/hermes-sync && git push origin main\n```\n\n**方案3：把 hermes-sync 的令牌配到 URL 里**\n跟 hermes-skills 一样的方式，以后我就能自动推了\n\n你选哪个？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1857,"output":485,"cacheRead":80832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83174,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779717451750}}
