{"type":"message","id":"f43481b3","parentId":"5c17e9da","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:05:00.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can't find the original askpass script. Let me be honest with VAN and explain the situation clearly. The script that was used for git authentication is missing, and I can't recreate it without knowing the exact implementation. The simplest solution is for VAN to provide a GitHub Personal Access Token.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"查不到了。原来负责 git 认证的脚本 `/source/coze-git-askpass.sh` 丢失了，备份里也没有。\n\n**结论：** 这个沙箱环境的 GitHub 认证机制断了。之前的推送依赖这个脚本，现在它不见了。\n\n**最快的修复方式：** 你给我一个 GitHub Personal Access Token，我直接配上就能推。\n\n生成方式：\n1. 打开 https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\n2. 点 \"Generate new token\"\n3. 仓库权限选 hermes-sync，给 `Contents: Read and write`\n4. 把 token 发给我\n\n或者你本地手动推：\n```bash\ncd /tmp/hermes-sync && git push origin main\n```\n\n文件和 commit 都准备好了，就差这一步。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":199,"output":293,"cacheRead":97024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97516,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779717893788}}
