{"type":"message","id":"167b88ee","parentId":"b807ff65","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:07:31.498Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is pointing out that I was able to use the GitHub API to check the repo contents earlier. That's true - I used the GitHub REST API (api.github.com) which is a public API that doesn't require authentication for public repos. But pushing code requires authentication.\n\nLet me clarify this distinction.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"对，**读** 和 **写** 是两回事：\n\n| 操作 | 认证要求 | 我能做？ |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 读仓库信息（API查看文件列表） | 公开仓库不需要认证 | ✅ 能 |\n| 克隆仓库（git clone） | 公开仓库不需要认证 | ✅ 能 |\n| 推送代码（git push） | **必须认证** | ❌ 不能 |\n\nhermes-sync 是公开仓库，所以 API 查看和 clone 都没问题。但 push 不管仓库是否公开，GitHub 都要求认证。\n\n**简单说：我能看，能下载，但不能上传。**\n\n要推上去还是需要你给我一个 GitHub token，或者你本地手动推。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":513,"output":291,"cacheRead":97216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98020,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779718044027}}
