{"type":"message","id":"59fd1149","parentId":"da9bd8a2","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:35:18.756Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying the token doesn't have an expiration date and is always valid. But it's not working for git push. Let me think about why...\n\nThe error is \"Invalid username or token. Password authentication is not supported for Git operations.\"\n\nThis could mean:\n1. The token is actually invalid/revoked\n2. The token format is wrong\n3. GitHub has changed their authentication requirements\n4. The token needs to be used differently\n\nWait - GitHub fine-grained tokens start with `github_pat_` but the format might have changed. Let me check if the token is being URL-encoded properly. The token might contain special characters that need encoding.\n\nActually, let me check the token length. \n\nThe token looks truncated or incomplete - `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` doesn't have the full structure I'd expect from a fine-grained token. GitHub PATs typically have a specific format with underscores separating sections, and this one seems to be cut off mid-sequence.\n\nThe authentication error \"Password authentication is not supported for Git operations\" is the real clue here - GitHub deprecated password auth in 2021, so the issue isn't the token itself but how it's being passed to git. I should verify the token works with the GitHub API first, then figure out the correct authentication method for the git remote.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我验证一下这个token是否对GitHub API有效："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c34d316fe0d044dcba145438","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: token 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\" https://api.github.com/user 2>&1 | head -10","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":415,"output":771,"cacheRead":38272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39458,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779719704684}}
