{"type":"message","id":"e9fca0a0","parentId":"ae1d280d","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:35:25.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token is invalid - GitHub returns \"Bad credentials\". So the token is either expired, revoked, or incorrect. VAN says it doesn't have an expiration date, but GitHub is rejecting it.\n\nLet me inform VAN that the token is being rejected by GitHub and they need to generate a new one.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub API 返回 `Bad credentials` — 这个token已被GitHub拒绝（可能被撤销或失效）。\n\nVAN，不管原来有没有过期时间，GitHub现在不认这个token了。需要生成一个新的。\n\n步骤很简单：\n1. 打开 https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\n2. 点 \"Generate new token\"\n3. 选仓库：hermes-skills + hermes-sync\n4. 权限：Contents → Read and write\n5. 生成后把token发我\n\n30秒搞定。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":522,"output":238,"cacheRead":38656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39416,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779719719329}}
