{"type":"message","id":"8bb05456","parentId":"bfde6904","timestamp":"2026-05-25T15:04:41.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token works. Now I need to persist it so it survives sandbox restarts. Let me add it to environment variables and a startup script.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Token有效，GitHub认证成功。现在持久化存储："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_935437c4e61248b6922c0363","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Persist to env file that survives restarts\nmkdir -p /workspace/projects/.config\ncat > /workspace/projects/.config/github-token.env << 'EOF'\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=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\nexport GIT_ASKPASS=echo\nEOF\n\n# Also add to .bashrc for shell sessions\necho 'source /workspace/projects/.config/github-token.env 2>/dev/null' >> ~/.bashrc\n\n# Create a git credential helper script\ncat > /workspace/projects/.config/git-credential-helper.sh << 'SCRIPT'\n#!/bin/bash\necho \"username=xianfanhuang\"\necho \"password=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\"\nSCRIPT\nchmod +x /workspace/projects/.config/git-credential-helper.sh\n\n# Configure git to use credential helper\ngit config --global credential.helper \"/workspace/projects/.config/git-credential-helper.sh\"\n\necho \"PERSISTED\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":507,"output":333,"cacheRead":39680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40520,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779721469193}}
