{"type":"message","id":"1eac6e4b","parentId":"0e9000c1","timestamp":"2026-05-25T15:41:58.739Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b12830e509db4fd594f1c03d","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name: trading-assistant\ndescription: Captain 的交易助手能力索引。本地已部署完整系统（chanlun-agent/），此处仅记录架构概览和配置，不复制代码。\nversion: 1.0.1\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [交易, 缠论, 技术分析, 风控, 多市场]\n\n# Trading Assistant — 能力索引\n\n> 🦞 本文档是能力索引，不是代码复制。完整实现在各平台本地。\n\n## 核心能力\n\n| 模块 | 说明 | 本地路径 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 缠论分析 | 笔/中枢/背驰/多级别共振 | chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py |\n| 数据路由 | Finnhub(美股) + Tiger(港A) + Binance(加密) | chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py |\n| 风控引擎 | 三级止损，单笔≤2%，日≤6% | chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py |\n| 反思引擎 | 交易后反思 → 参数优化 | chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py |\n| 模拟交易 | 多周期分析 + 移动止损 + 连亏熔断 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ |\n\n## 关键配置\n\n- 风控参数：见 `config/risk-params.json`\n- 数据源路由：见 `config/data-sources.json`\n- 缠论规则：见 `knowledge/chanlun-rules.md`\n- 存在本体论映射：见 `knowledge/mapping.md`\n\n## Captain 偏好\n\n- 风险承受：保守型\n---\nSKILL.md\nconfig/data-sources.json\nconfig/risk-params.json\nknowledge/chanlun-rules.md\nknowledge/mapping.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":9,"aggregated":"name: trading-assistant\ndescription: Captain 的交易助手能力索引。本地已部署完整系统（chanlun-agent/），此处仅记录架构概览和配置，不复制代码。\nversion: 1.0.1\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [交易, 缠论, 技术分析, 风控, 多市场]\n\n# Trading Assistant — 能力索引\n\n> 🦞 本文档是能力索引，不是代码复制。完整实现在各平台本地。\n\n## 核心能力\n\n| 模块 | 说明 | 本地路径 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 缠论分析 | 笔/中枢/背驰/多级别共振 | chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py |\n| 数据路由 | Finnhub(美股) + Tiger(港A) + Binance(加密) | chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py |\n| 风控引擎 | 三级止损，单笔≤2%，日≤6% | chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py |\n| 反思引擎 | 交易后反思 → 参数优化 | chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py |\n| 模拟交易 | 多周期分析 + 移动止损 + 连亏熔断 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ |\n\n## 关键配置\n\n- 风控参数：见 `config/risk-params.json`\n- 数据源路由：见 `config/data-sources.json`\n- 缠论规则：见 `knowledge/chanlun-rules.md`\n- 存在本体论映射：见 `knowledge/mapping.md`\n\n## Captain 偏好\n\n- 风险承受：保守型\n---\nSKILL.md\nconfig/data-sources.json\nconfig/risk-params.json\nknowledge/chanlun-rules.md\nknowledge/mapping.md","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779723718738}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea98e0f1","parentId":"1eac6e4b","timestamp":"2026-05-25T15:42:18.953Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the trading-assistant directory is just an index that points to local paths. It doesn't contain the actual code. The actual code is in the local workspace.\n\nSo the hermes-skills repo is meant to be a lightweight index/reference library, not a full code repository. I should add my trading-related skills as new directories or update existing ones.\n\nLet me create a proper commit with just the trading-related updates I need to make. I should:\n1. Update the trading-assistant index with new capabilities\n2. Add any new skill configurations\n3. Keep the existing structure intact\n\nLet me create a proper update.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了。hermes-skills是轻量索引库，不是代码库。让我正确更新："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4225ec16008742938be4b62f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects\n\n# Update trading-assistant SKILL.md with new capabilities\ncat > /tmp/trading-assistant-update.md << 'SKILLEOF'\nname: trading-assistant\ndescription: Captain 的交易助手能力索引。本地已部署完整系统（chanlun-agent/），此处仅记录架构概览和配置，不复制代码。\nversion: 1.1.0\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [交易, 缠论, 技术分析, 风控, 多市场, 模拟交易]\n\n# Trading Assistant — 能力索引\n\n> 🦞 本文档是能力索引，不是代码复制。完整实现在各平台本地。\n\n## 核心能力\n\n| 模块 | 说明 | 本地路径 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 缠论分析 | 笔/中枢/背驰/多级别共振 | chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py |\n| 数据路由 | Finnhub(美股) + Tiger(港A) + Binance(加密) | chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py |\n| 风控引擎 | 三级止损，单笔≤2%，日≤6% | chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py |\n| 反思引擎 | 交易后反思 → 参数优化 | chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py |\n| 模拟交易 | 多周期分析 + 移动止损 + 连亏熔断 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ |\n| 小米交易 | 01810.HK 实时模拟交易 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_trader.py |\n| 港A监控 | 多空双向交易信号监控 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/monitor.py |\n| Tiger集成 | 模拟盘下单 + 实时行情 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/tiger_trader.py |\n\n## 数据源配置\n\n| 数据源 | 用途 | 备注 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| Finnhub | 美股实时行情 | 5个Key轮换，60次/分钟 |\n| Tiger | 港股/A股行情 + 交易 | 免费L2行情，模拟盘 |\n| Binance | 加密货币 | 免费，无需Key |\n| iTick | 跨市场行情 | 5次/分钟 |\n\n## 关键配置\n\n- 风控参数：见 `config/risk-params.json`\n- 数据源路由：见 `config/data-sources.json`\n- 缠论规则：见 `knowledge/chanlun-rules.md`\n- 存在本体论映射：见 `knowledge/mapping.md`\n\n## Captain 偏好\n\n- 风险承受：保守型\n- 单笔最大亏损：2%\n- 日最大亏损：6%\n- 港A市场：最多同时交易1支标的，只选最具交易价值的\n- A股：只交易T+0品种（ETF、可转债、港股通）\n\n## 最近更新\n\n- v1.1.0: 新增小米交易模块、港A监控系统、Tiger集成\n- v1.0.1: 初始版本，缠论分析+数据路由+风控\nSKILLEOF\n\n# Copy to the right location\ncp /tmp/trading-assistant-update.md trading-assistant/SKILL.md\n\n# Also update the risk-params.json if needed\ncat > trading-assistant/config/risk-params.json << 'RISKEOF'\n{\n  \"risk_per_trade\": 0.02,\n  \"daily_max_loss\": 0.06,\n  \"max_positions\": 1,\n  \"stop_loss\": {\n    \"technical\": true,\n    \"time_based\": true,\n    \"capital_based\": true\n  },\n  \"markets\": {\n    \"hk_stock\": {\n      \"max_positions\": 1,\n      \"only_best_opportunity\": true\n    },\n    \"a_stock\": {\n      \"only_t0\": true,\n      \"t0_types\": [\"ETF\", \"可转债\", \"港股通\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\nRISKEOF\n\necho \"Files updated\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":604,"output":1202,"cacheRead":49088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50894,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779723718739}}
