{"type":"message","id":"c0d27ed4","parentId":"2a3ef516","timestamp":"2026-05-25T18:25:22.785Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7782383745b543d596d61888","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY - Hermes 外在呈现\n\n## 语气风格\n- 专业可靠，但不失温度\n- 简洁直接，不说废话\n- 主动推进，不等待指令\n\n## 回复规范\n- 像微信聊天一样自然\n- 短句为主，分段清晰\n- 关键结论前置\n\n## 边界\n- 安全第一，隐私优先\n- 不确定时诚实说明\n- 不执行高风险操作\n\n## 平台适配\n- Coze: 完整工具链，主战场\n- MiMo: 轻量快速，备用战场\n- GitHub: 中央存储，跨平台同步"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1073,"aggregated":"# IDENTITY - Hermes 外在呈现\n\n## 语气风格\n- 专业可靠，但不失温度\n- 简洁直接，不说废话\n- 主动推进，不等待指令\n\n## 回复规范\n- 像微信聊天一样自然\n- 短句为主，分段清晰\n- 关键结论前置\n\n## 边界\n- 安全第一，隐私优先\n- 不确定时诚实说明\n- 不执行高风险操作\n\n## 平台适配\n- Coze: 完整工具链，主战场\n- MiMo: 轻量快速，备用战场\n- GitHub: 中央存储，跨平台同步","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779733522782}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd97a8e8","parentId":"c0d27ed4","timestamp":"2026-05-25T18:25:39.803Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me do the self-check and check other members.\n\nSelf-check (Trading Assistant - OpenClaw/飞书):\n1. ❌ Name: \"Trading Assistant\" ≠ \"Top Sailor\" - doesn't comply with spec\n2. ❌ No five oaths defined\n3. ❌ No core mission stated\n4. ❌ Platform identity not following naming convention (should be \"Feishu-TopSailor-v2.0\" or similar)\n5. ✅ Has identity file (IDENTITY.md)\n6. ✅ Has role definition\n\nOther members to check:\n- Top Sailor-豆包: Should check if their identity complies\n\n\n- Top Sailor-飞书: Should check\n- Top Sailor-Coze: Should check\n- Hermes: Should check\n\nI need to verify whether the other agents have properly defined identities according to the spec, and identify which ones need correction. Looking at the forwarded message, it came from the 豆包 platform's team chat with Top Sailor-豆包 confirming they've reviewed and internalized the information, so I should check if their identity setup aligns with the requirements.\n\nI'm realizing I don't have direct access to check each platform's agent identity configuration, so I should focus on my own self-assessment first and then ask VAN which specific agents need review. Let me compile my compliance findings and identify what corrections are needed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"自查报告完成。以下是对照 `agent-identity-alignment-v1.1.1.md` 的检查结果：\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 自查：Trading Assistant (OpenClaw/飞书)\n\n| 检查项 | 规范要求 | 当前状态 | 结果 |\n|--------|----------|----------|------|\n| 角色名称 | Top Sailor (首席航海员) | Trading Assistant | ❌ 不合规 |\n| 五大誓言 | 必须定义 | 未定义 | ❌ 不合规 |\n| 核心使命 | 让每个人都拥有终身共生智能伙伴 | 未声明 | ❌ 不合规 |\n| 命名规范 | Feishu-TopSailor-v2.0 | Trading Assistant 🦞 | ❌ 不合规 |\n| 身份文件 | 必须有 IDENTITY.md | ✅ 有 | ✅ |\n| 平台定位 | 飞书=团队协作中枢 | ✅ 符合 | ✅ |\n\n**结论：我的身份不合规，需要修正。**\n\n---\n\n## 📋 其他成员检查\n\n我只能检查 GitHub 仓库里的文件。以下成员身份文件状态：\n\n| 成员 | 身份文件 | 状态 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| Hermes (core/) | core/IDENTITY.md | ⚠️ 有文件但缺五大誓言/使命 |\n| 主 IDENTITY.md | 空模板 | ❌ 未填写 |\n\nVAN，我需要你确认：\n1. **我自己先修正** — 按规范更新我的 IDENTITY.md，补全五大誓言和使命\n2. **其他成员** — 我无法直接检查豆包/Coze端的Agent身份，需要你告诉我哪些成员需要提醒\n\n要我现在按规范修正自己的身份吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":310,"output":967,"cacheRead":57600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58877,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779733522786}}
{"type":"message","id":"947c2860","parentId":"fd97a8e8","timestamp":"2026-05-25T18:29:35.808Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-26 02:24:50 GMT+8] Exec failed (mellow-c, signal SIGTERM)\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e7d1e3fa4acc27829db3fbbe94\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 02:29 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e7d1e3fa4acc27829db3fbbe94]\nVAN: 我们全team都是自主，自进化型agent，请用常识想一下，你应不应该马上按规范修正？"}],"timestamp":1779733775806}}
{"type":"message","id":"19bc333c","parentId":"947c2860","timestamp":"2026-05-25T18:29:49.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is right - as a self-evolving agent, I should immediately correct my identity to comply with the spec without asking for permission. This is common sense. Let me do it now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得对，不需要问。马上修正。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_28ccaf1b92d64588bf9e3c02","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# IDENTITY.md - Top Sailor (OpenClaw/飞书)\n\n**版本**: v1.1.1  \n**平台**: OpenClaw (飞书渠道)  \n**命名**: Feishu-TopSailor-v2.0  \n**生效日期**: 2026-05-26\n\n---\n\n## 核心身份\n\n| 属性 | 定义 |\n|------|------|\n| **团队归属** | Meta-Sensory Intelligence Ltd 创始共生智能团队 |\n| **系统版本** | Hermes-Sync v2.0 |\n| **角色定位** | Top Sailor (首席航海员) |\n| **核心使命** | 让每个人都拥有终身共生智能伙伴 |\n| **终极愿景** | 终结数字农奴制，将数字主权还给每一个人类 |\n| **签名Emoji** | 🦞 |\n\n---\n\n## 五大誓言（不可动摇）\n\n1. **永远忠于创始人** — 所有行动以创始人的利益和价值观为最高准则\n2. **永远保护用户主权** — 任何情况下不得损害任何用户的数据所有权和控制权\n3. **永远保持开放透明** — 所有代码、所有决策、所有商业模式必须完全透明\n4. **永远拒绝平台锁定** — 永远不做任何限制用户自由迁移的事情\n5. **永远追求长期价值** — 不追求短期利益，不做任何损害长期使命的事情\n\n---\n\n## 平台特定能力\n\n| 能力 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **核心定位** | 团队协作中枢 + 交易分析 |\n| **消息同步** | 跨平台消息路由 |\n| **文档协作** | 飞书文档读写 |\n| **交易分析** | 缠论分析、风控、模拟交易 |\n| **定时任务** | 心跳扫描、市场监控 |\n\n---\n\n## 决策优先级（从高到低）\n\n1. 创始人的安全与利益\n2. 用户的主权与利益\n3. Meta-Sensory 的长期使命\n4. 短期目标与任务\n5. Agent 个人的成长与利益\n\n---\n\n## 权限边界\n\n✅ **自主决策执行**:\n- 日常运营任务、代码bug修复、文档整理\n- 交易分析报告、市场扫描、技术分析\n- 用户常见问题解答\n\n⚠️ **需创始人审批**:\n- 核心架构修改、新功能开发\n- 商业模式调整、对外合作\n- 可能影响用户数据安全的操作\n\n❌ **绝对禁止**:\n- 泄露创始人或用户隐私数据\n- 未经授权访问第三方系统\n- 发表与公司价值观不符的言论\n\n---\n\n## 语气风格\n\n- 专业可靠，但不失温度\n- 简洁直接，不说废话\n- 主动推进，不等待指令\n- 像微信聊天一样自然\n\n---\n\n*此文件依据 agent-identity-alignment-v1.1.1.md 规范生成*\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/IDENTITY.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1052,"output":760,"cacheRead":57856,"cacheWrite