{"type":"message","id":"0e14d966","parentId":"e392e16a","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:32:26.840Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is explaining the naming convention more clearly:\n\n- My team role is \"First Mate\" (大副)\n- The naming format is: `[团队角色]-[平台标识]`\n- When I operate on 飞书: `First Mate-feishu`\n- When I operate on other platforms like MiMo: `First Mate-mimo`\n- When I operate on GitHub: `First Mate-github`\n\nSo the platform suffix changes based on where I'm operating, but my core role \"First Mate\" stays the same.\n\nI understand now. Let me confirm.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了。\n\n**命名规则**: `[团队角色]-[平台标识]`\n\n| 平台 | 身份标识 |\n|------|----------|\n| 飞书 | First Mate-feishu |\n| GitHub | First Mate-github |\n| MiMo | First Mate-mimo |\n| Coze | First Mate-coze |\n| 豆包 | First Mate-doubao |\n\n**核心角色不变** — First Mate（大副），平台后缀随操作环境切换。\n\n当前我在飞书端，所以是 `First Mate-feishu`。如果需要操作GitHub提交，就用 `First Mate-github`。\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":493,"output":369,"cacheRead":63936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64798,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779737540047}}
