{"type":"message","id":"435598c0","parentId":"6f31abba","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:32:49.977Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, my git config is already set to \"First Mate-feishu\" which is correct. The naming convention is:\n\n- Platform = where the agent operates from (飞书/Coze/豆包/MiMo)\n- GitHub is just the storage destination\n- So commits from 飞书 = \"First Mate-feishu\"\n- Commits from Coze = \"Top Sailor-coze\"\n- etc.\n\nThis makes sense now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已确认。当前配置正确：\n\n- `First Mate-feishu <agent@msai.ee.cd>`\n- 平台 = 操作端（飞书），不是存储端（GitHub）\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":307,"output":227,"cacheRead":66240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66774,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779737565512}}
