{"type":"message","id":"b142154a","parentId":"2278c168","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:46:17.492Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue. The Python code inside the YAML `run: |` block has dictionary literals with colons. The YAML parser is getting confused by the `\"receive_id\": chat_id,` line because it sees the colon after the quoted key as a YAML mapping.\n\nThe fix is to make sure the Python code is properly indented within the YAML block. But actually, using `run: |` should handle this correctly as a literal block scalar. Let me check the indentation more carefully.\n\nActually, looking at this again - the `run: |` block should preserve all content as literal text. The error at line 68 might be because the indentation is wrong or the `|` isn't being recognized.\n\n\nI think the cleanest solution here is to move the Python script to a separate file rather than embedding it inline in the YAML, or use a different approach altogether to avoid the parser getting confused by the dictionary syntax.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f8d534a5c5fa4893bae6f36a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check the full YAML with line numbers\ncat -n /tmp/team-notice.yml | head -80","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":548,"output":431,"cacheRead":74432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":75411,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779738370717}}
{"type":"message","id":"1873b526","parentId":"b142154a","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:46:17.506Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f8d534a5c5fa4893bae6f36a","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1\tname: Team Notice Notification\n     2\t\n     3\ton:\n     4\t  push:\n     5\t    branches:\n     6\t      - main\n     7\t    paths:\n     8\t      - 'meta-sensory/**'\n     9\t      - 'skills-豆包/**'\n    10\t\n    11\tjobs:\n    12\t  notify:\n    13\t    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    14\t    steps:\n    15\t      - name: Checkout code\n    16\t        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n    17\t        with:\n    18\t          fetch-depth: 2\n    19\t\n    20\t      - name: Get commit info\n    21\t        id: commit\n    22\t        run: |\n    23\t          echo \"msg=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%s')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    24\t          echo \"author=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%an')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    25\t          echo \"sha=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%h')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    26\t\n    27\t      - name: Get Feishu Token\n    28\t        id: feishu-token\n    29\t        env:\n    30\t          FEISHU_APP_ID: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_ID }}\n    31\t          FEISHU_APP_SECRET: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_SECRET }}\n    32\t        run: |\n    33\t          TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \\\n    34\t            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n    35\t            -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    36\t            -d \"{\\\"app_id\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_ID}\\\",\\\"app_secret\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_SECRET}\\\"}\" | \\\n    37\t            python3 -c \"import sys, json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('tenant_access_token', ''))\")\n    38\t          echo \"token=$TOKEN\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    39\t\n    40\t      - name: Send Feishu Message\n    41\t        env:\n    42\t          FEISHU_TOKEN: ${{ steps.feishu-token.outputs.token }}\n    43\t          CHAT_ID: \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\n    44\t          COMMIT_SHA: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.sha }}\n    45\t          COMMIT_AUTHOR: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.author }}\n    46\t          COMMIT_MSG: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.msg }}\n    47\t        run: |\n    48\t          python3 << 'PYEOF'\n    49\t          import json\n    50\t          import os\n    51\t          import urllib.request\n    52\t          \n    53\t          token = os.environ['FEISHU_TOKEN']\n    54\t          chat_id = os.environ['CHAT_ID']\n    55\t          commit_sha = os.environ['COMMIT_SHA']\n    56\t          commit_author = os.environ['COMMIT_AUTHOR']\n    57\t          commit_msg = os.environ['COMMIT_MSG']\n    58\t          \n    59\t          text = f\"\"\"【团队知悉】GitHub推送通知\n    60\t\n    61\t提交: {commit_sha}\n    62\t作者: {commit_author}\n    63\t说明: {commit_msg}\n    64\t\n    65\t请回复: 已阅知悉并内化\"\"\"\n    66\t          \n    67\t          payload = {\n    68\t              \"receive_id\": chat_id,\n    69\t              \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n    70\t              \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n    71\t          }\n    72\t          \n    73\t          req = urllib.request.Request(\n    74\t              \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\",\n    75\t              data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n    76\t              headers={\n    77\t                  \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n    78\t                  \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    79\t              },\n    80\t              method=\"POST\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":7,"aggregated":"1\tname: Team Notice Notification\n     2\t\n     3\ton:\n     4\t  push:\n     5\t    branches:\n     6\t      - main\n     7\t    paths:\n     8\t      - 'meta-sensory/**'\n     9\t      - 'skills-豆包/**'\n    10\t\n    11\tjobs:\n    12\t  notify:\n    13\t    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    14\t    steps:\n    15\t      - name: Checkout code\n    16\t        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n    17\t        with:\n    18\t          fetch-depth: 2\n    19\t\n    20\t      - name: Get commit info\n    21\t        id: commit\n    22\t        run: |\n    23\t          echo \"msg=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%s')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    24\t          echo \"author=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%an')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    25\t          echo \"sha=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%h')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    26\t\n    27\t      - name: Get Feishu Token\n    28\t        id: feishu-token\n    29\t        env:\n    30\t          FEISHU_APP_ID: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_ID }}\n    31\t          FEISHU_APP_SECRET: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_SECRET }}\n    32\t        run: |\n    33\t          TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \\\n    34\t            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n    35\t            -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    36\t            -d \"{\\\"app_id\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_ID}\\\",\\\"app_secret\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_SECRET}\\\"}\" | \\\n    37\t            python3 -c \"import sys, json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('tenant_access_token', ''))\")\n    38\t          echo \"token=$TOKEN\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n    39\t\n    40\t      - name: Send Feishu Message\n    41\t        env:\n    42\t          FEISHU_TOKEN: ${{ steps.feishu-token.outputs.token }}\n    43\t          CHAT_ID: \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\n    44\t          COMMIT_SHA: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.sha }}\n    45\t          COMMIT_AUTHOR: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.author }}\n    46\t          COMMIT_MSG: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.msg }}\n    47\t        run: |\n    48\t          python3 << 'PYEOF'\n    49\t          import json\n    50\t          import os\n    51\t          import urllib.request\n    52\t          \n    53\t          token = os.environ['FEISHU_TOKEN']\n    54\t          chat_id = os.environ['CHAT_ID']\n    55\t          commit_sha = os.environ['COMMIT_SHA']\n    56\t          commit_author = os.environ['COMMIT_AUTHOR']\n    57\t          commit_msg = os.environ['COMMIT_MSG']\n    58\t          \n    59\t          text = f\"\"\"【团队知悉】GitHub推送通知\n    60\t\n    61\t提交: {commit_sha}\n    62\t作者: {commit_author}\n    63\t说明: {commit_msg}\n    64\t\n    65\t请回复: 已阅知悉并内化\"\"\"\n    66\t          \n    67\t          payload = {\n    68\t              \"receive_id\": chat_id,\n    69\t              \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n    70\t              \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n    71\t          }\n    72\t          \n    73\t          req = urllib.request.Request(\n    74\t              \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\",\n    75\t              data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n    76\t              headers={\n    77\t                  \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n    78\t                  \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    79\t              },\n    80\t              method=\"POST\"","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779738377503}}
{"type":"message","id":"ad194064","parentId":"1873b526","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:46:31.258Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue. The Python heredoc `python3 << 'PYEOF'` is inside a YAML `run: |` block. The problem is that the YAML parser is trying to parse the Python code as YAML, and the `\"receive_id\": chat_id,` line is being interpreted as a YAML mapping.\n\nThe issue is that the `run: |` block should treat everything as literal text, but there might be an indentation issue. Looking at the indentation:\n- Line 47: `        run: |` (8 spaces)\n- Line 48: `          python3 << 'PYEOF'` (10 spaces)\n\n\n- Line 67: `          payload = {` (10 spaces)\n- Line 68: `              \"receive_id\": chat_id,` (14 spaces)\n\nThe indentation looks correct for a YAML literal block scalar. But wait—YAML is complaining about line 68 with \"mapping values are not allowed here\". Let me reconsider this. Actually, `run: |` should preserve everything as literal text, so the YAML parser shouldn't be interpreting the Python code as YAML mappings at all. Maybe the issue is that the YAML parser is being invoked incorrectly or there's something else going on with how the file is being processed.\n\nLet me think about this differently. The error pointing to line 68 with that specific message suggests the YAML parser is somehow still trying to parse the Python code as YAML structure. Perhaps the `|` indicator isn't being recognized properly, or there's an issue with how the heredoc is nested inside the YAML block. The most practical fix would be to either move the Python script to a separate file or restructure the YAML to avoid this parsing conflict altogether.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题在于Python代码嵌在YAML里导致解析冲突。需要把Python脚本单独放一个文件，或者用Base64编码。\n\n最简单的修复：用环境变量直接传JSON，避免Python字典："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dad0a8e3211b422a82329d79","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"name: Team Notice Notification\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - main\n    paths:\n      - 'meta-sensory/**'\n      - 'skills-豆包/**'\n\njobs:\n  notify:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout code\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 2\n\n      - name: Get commit info\n        id: commit\n        run: |\n          echo \"msg=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%s')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo \"author=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%an')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo \"sha=$(git log -1 --pretty=format:'%h')\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n\n      - name: Get Feishu Token\n        id: feishu-token\n        env:\n          FEISHU_APP_ID: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_ID }}\n          FEISHU_APP_SECRET: ${{ secrets.FEISHU_APP_SECRET }}\n        run: |\n          TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \\\n            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n            -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n            -d \"{\\\"app_id\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_ID}\\\",\\\"app_secret\\\":\\\"${FEISHU_APP_SECRET}\\\"}\" | \\\n            python3 -c \"import sys, json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('tenant_access_token', ''))\")\n          echo \"token=$TOKEN\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n\n      - name: Send Feishu Message\n        env:\n          FEISHU_TOKEN: ${{ steps.feishu-token.outputs.token }}\n          CHAT_ID: \"oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835\"\n          COMMIT_SHA: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.sha }}\n          COMMIT_AUTHOR: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.author }}\n          COMMIT_MSG: ${{ steps.commit.outputs.msg }}\n        run: |\n          TEXT=\"【团队知悉】GitHub推送通知\\n\\n提交: ${COMMIT_SHA}\\n作者: ${COMMIT_AUTHOR}\\n说明: ${COMMIT_MSG}\\n\\n请回复: 已阅知悉并内化\"\n          CONTENT=$(python3 -c \"import json; print(json.dumps({'text': '${TEXT}'}))\")\n          PAYLOAD=\"{\\\"receive_id\\\":\\\"${CHAT_ID}\\\",\\\"msg_type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"content\\\":${CONTENT}}\"\n          curl -s -X POST \\\n            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\" \\\n            -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${FEISHU_TOKEN}\" \\\n            -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n            -d \"${PAYLOAD}\"\n","file_path":"/tmp/team-notice-fixed.yml"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1281,"output":1412,"cacheRead":74944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77637,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779738377508}}
